# ===========================
# BOT VERIFICATION GUIDELINES
# ===========================
# Legitimate bots can be verified via reverse DNS lookup:
# 1. Reverse DNS lookup on crawler IP → hostname
# 2. Forward DNS lookup on hostname → IP
# 3. Verify IP matches original crawler IP
#
# Example for Googlebot:
# - Reverse DNS should end in .googlebot.com or .google.com
# - Forward DNS should match original IP
#
# Known legitimate bot hostname patterns:
# - *.googlebot.com (Google)
# - *.search.msn.com (Bing)
# - *.crawl.amazonbot.amazon (Amazon)
# - *.fbsv.net (Facebook)
# - *.applebot.apple.com (Apple)

